<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Workspaces (中文)</title><link>https://workspaces.beehiiv.com/</link><description>探索激发生产力的工作空间。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Sat, 27 Jun 2026 13:27:04 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>马克西姆·赫克尔</title><link>https://workspaces.beehiiv.com/p/534-maxime-heckel</link><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://maximeheckel.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=maxime-heckel" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Maxime Heckel&lt;/a&gt; 是一名软件工程师，来自法国，现居纽约市。 &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;他目前在 Linear 担任产品工程师。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;业余时间，他喜欢捣鼓前端开发、WebGL/WebGPU、着色器，以及广义上的图形编程。计算机科学的这个领域是知识的无尽源泉，过去 5 年里他一直在尽可能多地学习。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;他把所有这些学习心得记录下来，并提炼成实验和文章，发布在他的博客上；他刚开始做博客时，希望当时就有这样的内容。博客也是他持续最久的副项目（今年已是第 8 年）。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Twitter（X）→ &lt;a href="https://x.com/MaximeHeckel?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=maxime-heckel" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;x.com/MaximeHeckel&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;GitHub → &lt;a href="https://github.com/maximeheckel?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=maxime-heckel" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;github.com/maximeheckel&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;博客 → &lt;a href="https://blog.maximeheckel.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=maxime-heckel" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;blog.maximeheckel.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/51290c69-a48a-4a66-b279-b1841120bb59/Maxime_Heckel_4.jpg?t=1782561893"/&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/b2c38fec-b6e2-4d6e-a891-318c70d1c677/Maxime_Heckel_2.jpg?t=1782561918"/&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/edfbb91b-5786-4fa8-a22c-482532a45b36/Maxime_Heckel_9.jpg?t=1782561983"/&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/6a93ab2b-14db-45af-b2a7-a0ef439d4b3c/Maxime_Heckel_8.jpg?t=1782562008"/&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/a5a7f174-c050-44d4-9232-38edc0d732b6/Maxime_Heckel_5.jpg?t=1782562033"/&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/71812809-cdd9-4c83-96f1-82df035cf444/Maxime_Heckel_1.jpg?t=1782562063"/&gt;&lt;h2&gt;你的工作空间里有哪些物品？&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;显示器：2022 年的 27 英寸 Apple Studio Display&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;MacBook Pro M4 Max，36GB 内存（银色）&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;显示器支架：&lt;a href="https://store.hermanmiller.com/home-desk-accessories/jarvis-single-monitor-arm/2548325.html?lang=en_US&amp;amp;utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=maxime-heckel" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Fully 的 Jarvis 显示器支架&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;桌垫：Grovemade 的羊毛毡桌垫（浅灰色）&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;键盘：&lt;a href="https://modedesigns.com/products/sixtyfive?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=maxime-heckel" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Mode SixtyFive（2024），带铜色点缀&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;鼠标：&lt;a href="https://amzn.to/4g3W0fD?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=maxime-heckel" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;MX Master 3 &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;触控板：&lt;a href="https://amzn.to/4wd84zN?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=maxime-heckel" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Apple Magic Trackpad（USB-C）&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.apple.com/airpods-pro/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=maxime-heckel" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;AirPods Pro 3&lt;/a&gt; 是我在书桌前或外出时日常使用的耳机&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;当我需要高麦克风质量时，会用 Apple USB-C 有线耳机&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;台灯：&lt;a href="https://www.mi.com/global/product/mi-led-desk-lamp-1s/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=maxime-heckel" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;小米米家智能 LED 台灯&lt;/a&gt;（我觉得现在已经买不到了）&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;笔袋：&lt;a href="https://amzn.to/4beLDSO?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=maxime-heckel" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;无印良品聚丙烯笔袋&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2&gt;书籍&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://fleuret.org/francois/lbdl.html?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=maxime-heckel" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;The Little Book of Deep Learning&lt;/a&gt;，作者 Francois Fleuret&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://amzn.to/3R1EbDP?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=maxime-heckel" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;The Shape of Design&lt;/a&gt;，作者 Frank Chimero&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://buddybindery.com/products/bootstrapping-computing?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=maxime-heckel" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Bootstrapping Computing&lt;/a&gt;，作者 Alexander D. Obenauer&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;（虽然我在科技行业工作，但我并不是特别痴迷“技术书”，不过这三本书我真的很喜欢，而且碰巧和我的桌面美学很搭）&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;你经常使用哪些软件？&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://arc.net/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=maxime-heckel" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Arc 浏览器&lt;/a&gt;（到了这个地步，你得从我冰冷的手里把它抢走才行）&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.raycast.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=maxime-heckel" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Raycast&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://mymind.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=maxime-heckel" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;MyMind&lt;/a&gt; 用来保存灵感&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://cursor.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=maxime-heckel" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Cursor&lt;/a&gt; 作为我的主要编辑器（我仍然手写代码）&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://openai.com/codex/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=maxime-heckel" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Codex&lt;/a&gt;（当我不想手写代码时）&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://ghostty.org/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=maxime-heckel" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Ghostty&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://linear.app/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=maxime-heckel" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Linear&lt;/a&gt;（即使在工作之外）&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Apple Notes（这是我一切内容的真相来源，我会存放并整理即将开展项目的灵感，以及博客文章的主题想法）。我喜欢这些内容可以离线使用，并在所有设备上自动同步，完全不用我操心。我信任 Apple 来保管我的笔记，不过我也设置了一些脚本，每月把它们以 Markdown 备份一次，“以防万一”，顺便也借此试用其他笔记应用&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://superwhisper.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=maxime-heckel" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Superwhisper&lt;/a&gt;（当我想对电脑说话而不是打字时）&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 27 Jun 2026 13:27:04 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>罗天成</title><link>https://workspaces.beehiiv.com/p/533-tiancheng-luo</link><description>&lt;p&gt;罗天成（又名 bbbigdear）是一位产品设计师兼科技与生活方式创作者，专注于工作空间美学、现代生活以及精心设计的科技产品。通过电影化的叙事方式和亲身的产品探索，他分享那些将功能性与视觉设计融为一体的工具和物品。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Instagram → &lt;a href="https://www.instagram.com/bbbigdeer/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=tiancheng-luo" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;instagram.com/bbbigdeer&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Threads → &lt;a href="https://www.threads.com/@bbbigdeer?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=tiancheng-luo" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;threads.com/@bbbigdeer&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;TikTok → &lt;a href="https://www.tiktok.com/@bbbigdeer?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=tiancheng-luo" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;tiktok.com/@bbbigdeer&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;YouTube → &lt;a href="https://www.youtube.com/@bigdeeer?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=tiancheng-luo" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;youtube.com/@bigdeeer&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/6c438768-b421-4d9b-87d8-065b787f5105/DSC00691.jpg?t=1781356253"/&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/d26029e6-c1a3-4cd5-8f65-f84e086d7bc6/DSC00650.jpg?t=1781356353"/&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/1b47e11a-2c6a-4f09-aa37-1de07bdb25bb/DSC00709.jpg?t=1781356371"/&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/f083ab73-6412-4ead-a530-716902177120/DSC00642.jpg?t=1781356383"/&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/2ce43d6a-bdbb-49ef-8d63-a4fd0ebe7a26/DSC00721.jpg?t=1781356406"/&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/fa4bc797-bcf0-4f10-a8ba-25aded6d6fe2/DSC00786.jpg?t=1781356421"/&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/433084ce-c5c0-427f-a4c0-47ff009ea4e9/DSC00747.jpg?t=1781356434"/&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/a9cf57db-ccf6-40a5-930d-db8c98101a7b/DSC00761.jpg?t=1781356447"/&gt;&lt;h2&gt;你工作空间里有哪些主要物品？&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://workspacesxyz.link/LShaped?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=tiancheng-luo" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Vernal L 形升降桌&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.apple.com/studio-display/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=tiancheng-luo" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Apple Studio Display&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Apple Mac Mini&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://amzn.to/3QeShkY?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=tiancheng-luo" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Lofree 触摸鼠标&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://amzn.to/3QmgoOC?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=tiancheng-luo" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Harman Kardon Aura Studio 音箱&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://amzn.to/4aqVbtC?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=tiancheng-luo" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Bambu Lab A1 3D 打印机&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;分体式人体工学机械键盘&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2&gt;你最近添置到工作空间的一件物品是什么？&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;我工作空间最近添置的是一张 &lt;a href="https://workspacesxyz.link/LShaped?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=tiancheng-luo" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Vernal 的 L 形升降桌&lt;/a&gt;。它彻底改变了我的桌面氛围，给了我更多空间来区分不同类型的工作，同时让整个环境感觉更有条理。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;h2&gt;你希望对你目前的工作空间做出的一项改变是什么？&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;我希望我的工作空间能让人感觉更平静、更有意图。不仅仅是桌面，而是以一种更立体的方式。目前，我觉得墙面空间还需要更用心的设计，让整个环境感觉更统一、更有条理。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;h2&gt;带我们了解一下你的早晨日常——你坐到桌前做的第一件事是什么？&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;打开音箱。这是我每天做的第一件事。音乐帮助我自然地切换到工作模式。之后，我通常会查看消息、整理当天的想法，然后慢慢进入拍摄或写脚本的状态。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;h2&gt;对你真正有效的一个效率技巧是什么？&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;我认为每个人都应该最终建立自己独特的工作流程，而不是试图复制别人的。目前，AI 大概占我工作室工作流程的 30% 左右，所以学习如何与 AI 工具协作对我来说变得非常重要。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;h2&gt;你每天使用的最被低估的应用或工具是什么？&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;ChatGPT。我认为每个人的 ChatGPT 都会随着时间变得不同。经过几个月的对话，它开始更深层次地理解你。对我来说，它不再只是一个工具，而是能帮助整理思路、完善概念、挑战我想法的东西。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;hr/&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.beehiiv.com/powered-by?publication_logo=https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.beehiiv.com%2Fcdn-cgi%2Fimage%2Ffit%3Dscale-down%2Cformat%3Dauto%2Conerror%3Dredirect%2Cquality%3D80%2Fuploads%2Fpublication%2Flogo%2F9e0ab799-69a2-448f-b9a1-c03f8f3356e9%2FLogo_2.png%3Fv%3D1790874602&amp;amp;publication_name=Workspaces&amp;amp;utm_campaign=ab3ba0e7-f734-4297-959d-c056ba0949b7&amp;amp;utm_medium=post_rss&amp;amp;utm_source=workspaces" target="_blank"&gt;由 beehiiv 提供支持&lt;/a&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 13 Jun 2026 13:52:51 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Jack Zerby</title><link>https://workspaces.beehiiv.com/p/240-jack-zerby</link><description>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,quality=80,width=1200,onerror=redirect/uploads/asset/file/83ffefc4-12e8-4eba-83aa-2833cea00251/Jack_Zerby_thumbnail.png?t=1781142493"/&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.jackzerby.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Jack Zerby&lt;/a&gt; is currently the Head of Design at &lt;a href="http://gumroad.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Gumroad&lt;/a&gt; and Founder of &lt;a href="http://dogma.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Dogma&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="http://designfordecks.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Design For Decks&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="http://biddyhq.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Biddy&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="http://getdohq.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;DOHQ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://Flavors.me?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Flavors.me&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href="https://www.businessinsider.com/what-is-goodsie-2011-5?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Goodsie&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;He has worked for companies like &lt;a href="https://vimeo.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Vimeo&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://pentagram.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Pentagram&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://frogdesign.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Frog&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://rga.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;R/GA&lt;/a&gt; and consulted for companies like &lt;a href="https://teachable.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Teachable&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://americanexpress.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Amex&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href="https://staked.us/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Staked&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Twitter → &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/jackzerby?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;twitter.com/jackzerby&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/82cc4dc3-638a-4519-812b-2f7d886e502a/image.png?t=1781142289"/&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/b0d3e3c1-2144-499a-9c87-dfa47ed0db9e/image.png?t=1781142303"/&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/f52ad4d3-6db1-43f2-8909-43f7de552298/image.png?t=1781142317"/&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/10e73223-99ca-43d5-bc5c-47dc9abef0f8/image.png?t=1781142331"/&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/bf263210-a906-497a-b49e-a224b5da2dc0/image.png?t=1781142346"/&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/57f0439f-b599-4d90-8837-1a2823061f7d/image.png?t=1781142360"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Jack's wife recently redesigned his workspace to be what it is you see today. &lt;a href="https://alovelyliving.com/office-update-featuring-ben-moore-caldwell-green/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby#/" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;You can (and should!) see additional photos and thinking behind the redesign here!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;What gear is included in your workspace?&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;iMac M1 in Green&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;MAudio Keystation 61 key MIDI Piano &lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;EV RE20 Mic for podcasting&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Pottery Barn Pittsburgh Standing Desk&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://diycandy.com/diy-industrial-pipe-shelving/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;DIY black pipe shelving&lt;/a&gt;‍&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fiddle Leaf Fig tree&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.target.com/p/modern-floor-lamp-with-table-brass-threshold-8482/-/A-85606489?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Standing lamp&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2&gt;What is your favorite item in your workspace?&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;My desk is definitely my fave. It’s got an old classic feel with the benefits of a modern standing desk.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;h2&gt;How do you spark creativity?&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;Lo-Fi beats station on Spotify and phone on silent. Love sites like siteinspire.com, but will also go to Barnes and Noble and buy a bunch of beautiful magazines in any category.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;h2&gt;How do you manage work-life balance?&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;I run everything through Notion and create tickets for all tasks for that week along with goals for each quarter. I stop work at 5:30 no matter what, eat dinner and hang with the fam till bedtime. No work on weekends helps clear my mind and prevent burnout.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;h2&gt;What do you think is the main benefit of remote work?&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;No distractions, no commuting and ability to structure my day around tasks to be completed, not the amount of hours at my desk.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;hr/&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.beehiiv.com/powered-by?publication_logo=https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.beehiiv.com%2Fcdn-cgi%2Fimage%2Ffit%3Dscale-down%2Cformat%3Dauto%2Conerror%3Dredirect%2Cquality%3D80%2Fuploads%2Fpublication%2Flogo%2F9e0ab799-69a2-448f-b9a1-c03f8f3356e9%2FLogo_2.png%3Fv%3D1790874602&amp;amp;publication_name=Workspaces&amp;amp;utm_campaign=fd1ec894-f391-4e98-9262-7cdd00e472ba&amp;amp;utm_medium=post_rss&amp;amp;utm_source=workspaces" target="_blank"&gt;Powered by beehiiv&lt;/a&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Jan 2023 06:00:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>杰克·雷恩斯</title><link>https://workspaces.beehiiv.com/p/252-jack-raines</link><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/Jack_Raines?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-raines" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Jack Raines&lt;/a&gt; 是财经博客 &lt;a href="https://www.youngmoney.co/subscribe?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-raines" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Young Money&lt;/a&gt; 的作者，有 31,000 人每周阅读两次。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;他还负责编辑 Litquidity 的每日财经通讯 &lt;a href="https://www.execsum.co/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-raines" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Exec Sum&lt;/a&gt;。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;他在做这些的同时，还是哥伦比亚商学院的 MBA 候选人。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;趣事：他曾被挪威驱逐出境，在阿根廷学会了跳萨尔萨舞，还差点因为一篇 &lt;a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/jackraines/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-raines" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;讽刺性的 LinkedIn 帖子&lt;/a&gt; 被商学院开除。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/2fbcbb73-0bf8-4377-a108-4ac404a2b846/image.png?t=1781141970"/&gt;&lt;h2&gt;你的工作空间里有哪些装备？&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Macbook Pro&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.thexebec.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-raines" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Xebec（外接双显示器）&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;蓝牙鼠标&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;日记本（其实不算工作空间的一部分，但总是在我的包里）&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2&gt;你工作空间里最喜欢的物品是什么？&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;我的 Xebec。它很便携，能让我的屏幕尺寸变为三倍。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;h2&gt;你如何激发创造力？&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;我从未激发过创造力，是创造力激发了我。创造力通常在我健身时、在地铁上，或凌晨 1 点在廉价酒吧里突然出现。当它出现时，我会给自己发几条简短的笔记，稍后坐在电脑前时再查看。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;h2&gt;你如何管理工作与生活的平衡？&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;管理工作与生活平衡的最佳方式，就是去做那些你感觉不需要平衡的事情。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;h2&gt;你典型的写作过程是什么样的？&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;我坐下来，写 15 分钟，然后上 Twitter 找一条我想引用的推文，在 Twitter 上拖延 20 分钟，把手机扔到床上，关掉 Twitter，继续拼命写通讯。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;hr/&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.beehiiv.com/powered-by?publication_logo=https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.beehiiv.com%2Fcdn-cgi%2Fimage%2Ffit%3Dscale-down%2Cformat%3Dauto%2Conerror%3Dredirect%2Cquality%3D80%2Fuploads%2Fpublication%2Flogo%2F9e0ab799-69a2-448f-b9a1-c03f8f3356e9%2FLogo_2.png%3Fv%3D1790874602&amp;amp;publication_name=Workspaces&amp;amp;utm_campaign=9f5948bf-7675-461c-a892-8a62fe13d825&amp;amp;utm_medium=post_rss&amp;amp;utm_source=workspaces" target="_blank"&gt;由 beehiiv 提供支持&lt;/a&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 08 Feb 2023 06:00:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>大卫·海涅迈尔·汉森</title><link>https://workspaces.beehiiv.com/p/253-david-heinemeier-hansson</link><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://dhh.dk?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=david-heinemeier-hansson" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;大卫·海涅迈尔·汉森&lt;/a&gt;，或称 DHH，不需要正式介绍。但我们还是要介绍一下。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;他是 &lt;a href="https://rubyonrails.org/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=david-heinemeier-hansson" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Ruby on Rails&lt;/a&gt; 的创造者，这个开源框架已被数十万开发者使用。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;他是 &lt;a href="https://basecamp.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=david-heinemeier-hansson" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Basecamp&lt;/a&gt; 和 &lt;a href="https://www.hey.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=david-heinemeier-hansson" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;HEY&lt;/a&gt; 的共同创始人。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;他是畅销书作者，并与联合创始人杰森·弗里德合著了四本书（&lt;a href="https://37signals.com/books/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=david-heinemeier-hansson#rework" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;重来&lt;/a&gt;、&lt;a href="https://37signals.com/books/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=david-heinemeier-hansson#calm" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;工作不必疯狂&lt;/a&gt;、&lt;a href="https://37signals.com/books/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=david-heinemeier-hansson#remote" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;远程：办公室非必需&lt;/a&gt; 和 &lt;a href="https://37signals.com/books/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=david-heinemeier-hansson#getting-real" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;务实&lt;/a&gt;）。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;如果这还不够，他还是 FIA 世界耐力锦标赛的 &lt;a href="https://dhh.dk/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=david-heinemeier-hansson#driver" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;赛车手&lt;/a&gt;。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Twitter → &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/dhh?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=david-heinemeier-hansson" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;twitter.com/dhh&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/269219fe-657a-455e-9fce-87aaafb183ec/image.png?t=1781141694"/&gt;&lt;h2&gt;你典型的一天是什么样的？&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;清晨用来送孩子上学。我通常大约8:30坐下来工作。然后通常会花一个小时左右处理邮件、报告之类的。之后，最棒的日子就是从那时起完全自由，可以投入到有趣、有挑战性的项目中，最好是编程或写作。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;h2&gt;你认为2023年远程工作的主要好处是什么？&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;我已经远程工作了二十年，对我来说好处始终如一。可以自由选择居住地，在提供完全宁静以专注工作的家庭办公室工作，并享受白天就在家人隔壁的灵活性。我不会拿它换任何东西。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;h2&gt;你个人如何在多个进行中的项目之间平衡工作？&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;我尝试按季节工作。有些季节专注于编程，有些专注于写作，还有些专注于业务本身。多任务处理是海市蜃楼。人类能做的只是来回折腾。所以每次只把一个大项目放在手头是快速推进的关键。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;hr/&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.beehiiv.com/powered-by?publication_logo=https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.beehiiv.com%2Fcdn-cgi%2Fimage%2Ffit%3Dscale-down%2Cformat%3Dauto%2Conerror%3Dredirect%2Cquality%3D80%2Fuploads%2Fpublication%2Flogo%2F9e0ab799-69a2-448f-b9a1-c03f8f3356e9%2FLogo_2.png%3Fv%3D1790874602&amp;amp;publication_name=Workspaces&amp;amp;utm_campaign=83a7dc4d-a69e-4e2c-9009-696c7bc81e7e&amp;amp;utm_medium=post_rss&amp;amp;utm_source=workspaces" target="_blank"&gt;由 beehiiv 提供支持&lt;/a&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 09 Feb 2023 06:00:00 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>